cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite this software and identify the commit or release used."
type: software
title: "Dredging footprint pipeline"
abstract: "AIS-based mapping of trailing-suction hopper dredging, seabed disturbance and first-year sediment-carbon remineralisation, with annual SVR cap, OCIM forcing and uncertainty assessment. Source-only reconstruction of the October 2026 GRIT workflows; external inputs and the full production environment are not supplied. See README.md for validation scope and remaining gaps."
